/ Confirmation de la copie au cycle suivant (epic #330, phase 4). Pas de bouton
  « Annuler » : l'icône de copie, restée sur la ligne, retire la copie au
  second clic (décision 6).
div[id="copied_toast_#{cycle_action.id}"
    class="archive-toast pointer-events-auto inline-flex items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-stone-900 text-white pl-4 pr-2 py-2 shadow-xl ring-1 ring-white/10"
    data-controller="undo-toast"
    data-undo-toast-duration-value="5000"]
  svg.w-3.5.h-3.5.text-sky-400 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
    rect x="9" y="9" width="12" height="12" rx="2" ry="2"
    path d="M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"
  span.text-sm
    - if copied
      | Copiée dans
    - else
      | Copie retirée de
    strong.ml-1 = target_cycle.name
  button[type="button" data-action="click->undo-toast#dismiss" class="text-white/60 hover:text-white px-1" aria-label="Fermer"]
    svg.w-3.h-3 xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"
      line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"
      line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"
